Every strategy in the module "simulator" returns the value "None".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" does not change the record "Elevator".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" is deterministic.
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" receives the list "candidates".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" receives the value "floor".
Every strategy in the registry "STRATEGIES" returns the record "Elevator".
The module "dispatch" contains the registry "STRATEGIES".
The registry "STRATEGIES" contains the strategy "nearest".
The registry "STRATEGIES" contains the strategy "round robin".
The registry "STRATEGIES" contains the strategy "zone".
